<p dir="auto">This PR adds the "Regex Tester &amp; Visualizer" tool to the JavaScript Regular Expressions guide. I have also re-organized the existing 'Tools' list into strict alphabetical order and fixed minor punctuation inconsistencies (like missing periods) to match MDN's style guide.</p>
