<p dir="auto">Adding this tool provides MDN readers with an additional high-quality resource for testing and visualizing regex patterns. The clean UI and visualization features help developers debug complex patterns more effectively. Ensuring alphabetical order and consistent punctuation improves the overall documentation quality.</p>
<h3 dir="auto">Additional details</h3>
<ul dir="auto">
<li>Formatted the tool list as a definition list as per MDN standards.</li>
<li>Verified that all links in the section are functional.</li>
</ul>
<h3 dir="auto">Related issues and pull requests</h3>
<p dir="auto">Relates to documentation improvement for the Regular Expressions guide.</p>]]></content>
